To handle timeouts, this implementation uses a try-catch block to catch any network failures or potential malformed responses gracefully and logs the error message using `console.error`. It also includes comprehensive unit tests covering various scenarios, including edge cases and stress tests, to validate its reliability and performance under realistic conditions.

