```
4. Lazy Loading and Backward Compatibility
-------------------------------------------

The library will include support for lazy loading, which can be used to load data from an external source only when it is needed. This can be done by using the `importlib` package to dynamically import modules. The library will also maintain backward compatibility through versioned JSON object classes, allowing developers to continue using their existing code even as new versions of the library are released.
