5. System Dependencies and Integration
--------------------------------------

The library will handle system dependencies and potential integration challenges with legacy systems, providing migration strategies to minimize downtime. This can be done by using the `importlib` package to dynamically import modules and the `functools.partial` function to wrap functions with specific arguments.
