```
6. JSON-to-Object and Object-to-JSON Conversions
-----------------------------------------------

The library will optimize JSON-to-object and object-to-JSON conversions, particularly for batch processing large datasets. This can be done by using the `json` package to parse JSON data and the `typing` module to provide type hints for the JSON data.
