To handle dynamic schema changes in real-time without requiring service restarts, the library provides a mechanism for updating the schema cache asynchronously using a background job queue. This ensures that any changes to the schema are immediately reflected in the data processing pipeline.

The library also prioritizes user experience over absolute performance during failures. To handle high-load conditions, it implements strategies for graceful degradation under heavy loads, which ensure that the system remains responsive and available even when under heavy load.

