}
```
8. Cross-Platform Compatibility: The logging service should be designed to support virtualized environments and cloud deployments, while maintaining high reliability and security standards. This can be achieved by using a reliable logging framework that is widely used and well-tested in the industry.
```c
#include <sys/types.h>
#include <sys/socket.h>
#include <netdb.h>
#include <arpa/inet.h>

int main(void) {
    // Initialize logging framework
    logging_init();

    // Start the logging service
