The `NetworkManager` class is templated on the type of the WebSocket connections it manages. It includes methods for connecting and disconnecting from WebSocket servers, sending and receiving messages, and checking whether all connections are open. The `connections_` vector contains the list of WebSocket connections managed by the `NetworkManager`. The `hostname_lookup_` map is used to look up hostnames based on socket file descriptors, and the `port_lookup_` map is used to look up port numbers based on hostnames.

Here is an example usage of the `NetworkManager`:
```
